# ThreadSanitizer suppression file for SV Node
#
# Usage:
#   TSAN_OPTIONS="suppressions=contrib/tsan.suppressions" ./src/bitcoind ...
#
# Running unit tests under TSan:
#   TSAN_OPTIONS="suppressions=contrib/tsan.suppressions" \
#     ./src/test/test_bitcoin \
#     --run_test='!protocol_tests/net_messages:!script_tests/op_pushdata4_op_size'
#
# The excluded tests allocate multi-GB buffers (up to 4GB+) to test extended
# block message and script handling. Under TSan's ~2x memory overhead for
# shadow memory, these exceed typical RAM limits and trigger the OOM killer.
#
# See https://github.com/google/sanitizers/wiki/ThreadSanitizerSuppressions

deadlock:libdb_cxx
race:libzmq
deadlock:CTxMemPool::Expire
deadlock:FindUndoPos
